## 2. `feature_app_llm` 是否使用 `DefaultInterpretationAudioEngine`？

**是。** 没有独立音频引擎实现。

### 工厂 wiring

`/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_audio/lib/src/provider/interpretation_audio_providers.dart` 第 37–48 行：

```37:48:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_audio/lib/src/provider/interpretation_audio_providers.dart
final interpretationAudioEngineFactoryProvider =
    Provider<InterpretationAudioEngineFactory>((ref) {
      // ...
      return ({
        purpose = InterpretationAudioPurpose.appLlm,
        InterpretationAudioProfile? profile,
      }) => DefaultInterpretationAudioEngine(
        profile: profile ?? purpose.defaultProfile,
        routePreference: routePreference,
      );
    });
```

App LLM 默认 profile 为 `androidMediaSpeaker`（第 56–57 行），但这 **只影响 Android** `AndroidAudioUsage`；iOS 仍走 `playAndRecord` + `voiceChat`。

### App LLM 控制器启动路径

`/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/ai/feature_app_llm/lib/src/controller/app_llm_controller.dart`：

```378:401:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/ai/feature_app_llm/lib/src/controller/app_llm_controller.dart
  Future<InterpretationAudioEngine?> _createAudioEngine() async {
    _log('audio engine starting');
    final engine = ref.read(interpretationAudioEngineFactoryProvider)(
      purpose: InterpretationAudioPurpose.appLlm,
    );
    try {
      await engine.start();
    } catch (e) {
      _log('audio engine start failed: $e');
      // ...
      return null;
    }
    _log('audio engine started');
    return engine;
  }
```

Wake 流程在第 275 行调用 `_createAudioEngine()` → `engine.start()`，即上述 TTS → mic → session 顺序。

`[AudioEngine] start (profile=...)` 日志只出现在 `DefaultInterpretationAudioEngine.start()`（第 68 行）；`runningLog.txt` 中的 `[AppLlmCtrl] audio engine starting/started` 与 `[AudioEngine] start` 成对出现，进一步确认同一路径。

